## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** Limited-time free-tier model surfaced only through the OpenCode Zen gateway (openai-compatible Chat Completions API) as a $0 offering. OpenCode Zen does not attribute an underlying vendor or base model, so its benchmark identity is unverified; it is reasoning-capable with text+image input, tool use, and a 1M context window.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen Chat Completions at `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions` (OpenAI-compatible); model id `opencode/exo-free` (confirmed by the Zen models registry `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/models`, read 2026-10-10). Zen docs: `https://opencode.ai/docs/zen`.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-10-06 (models.dev registry `release_date` / `last_updated`). Knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `opencode/exo-free` (Zen). No Free ID other than this entry; no Hugging Face card or vendor model page located.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M) total, max output 131,072 (128K) — verified (models.dev registry `models/dev/providers/opencode/models/exo-free.toml`).
- **Modalities:** text + image in, text out — verified (models.dev toml); reasoning enabled (`reasoning = true`, `reasoning_options.effort = ["high"]`) and tool calls enabled (`tool_call = true`, models.dev toml). No video/audio input or non-text output reported.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-10):** Free on Zen — 0 / 0 / 0 (input / output / cached), limited-time. Not zero-retention: "Exo Free: During its free period, collected data may be used to improve the model" (OpenCode Zen privacy section).
- **Architecture:** reasoning model, closed weights (`open_weights = false`, models.dev toml); parameter count and underlying vendor/base model not disclosed by Zen or the models.dev registry.

